13f69bf24ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e86311d95f83dbfe7714550f5034beea, https://si.imgix.net/c05c9acb/uploads/origins/e0f32dfe-0168-404a-959c-013f69bf24ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7def962fdc07579e19e54ca56d071858 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c05c9acb/uploads/origins/e0f32dfe-0168-404a-959c-013f69bf24ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9d8a6e7d105c31abd7dc80d08ead76a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつもお世話になっております。とりどり部長でございます。\n\nバブみある琴葉茜ママをお願いします。\n服装は割烹着、お胸は大盛りでお願いします（とは言うものの、盛り具合は柊さんのセンスで構いません） 。\n等身、SDは問いません。\n\nポーズはバブみ、ママみを感じる、甘えたくなる感じ…というふわっとした希望になります。\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@KaguyaHiiragi/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fproxy.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Favatar.webp%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%252Fmisskey%252F79f658c1-9037-4168-993e-47254f11fa6e.gif%26avatar%3D1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=926565a11c0e044dc3b7ccdd2992c699", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fproxy.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Favatar.webp%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%252Fmisskey%252F79f658c1-9037-4168-993e-47254f11fa6e.gif%26avatar%3D1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=926565a11c0e044dc3b7ccdd2992c699, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fproxy.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Favatar.webp%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%252Fmisskey%252F79f658c1-9037-4168-993e-47254f11fa6e.gif%26avatar%3D1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d683c17e242e6d3548de15d63669086 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fproxy.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Favatar.webp%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%252Fmisskey%252F79f658c1-9037-4168-993e-4